                        <div class="image-container">
                            <img src="/content/siliconlabs/en/wireless/bluetooth/sibg301-series-3-socs.thumb.256.144.png"/>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-text">
                            <div class="family-icons">
                                <div class="family-icon">
                                    <img src="/content/dam/siliconlabs/images/icons/protocol-icons/bluetooth.png"/>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="title">
                                Next-Gen Wireless SoC for Advanced LED Lighting and Home Automation
                            </h3>
                            <div class="custom-description">
                                The SiBG301 is optimized for LED Lighting and mains powered mesh networks, while providing high-performance compute and our most secure wireless platform.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        
                            <div class="show-more">
                                <div class="simple-cta cta-align-center ">
                                    <a href="javascript:void(0);" class="button primary-red">More Information</a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        
                        
                        <div class="connector hidden"></div>
                        <div class="additional-info hidden">
                            
                                <div class="product-family-addition row">
                                    <div class="column medium-8">
                                        <div class="product-banner">
                                            <div class="product-banner-head">
                                                <h2>Next-Gen Wireless SoC for Advanced LED Lighting and Home Automation</h2>
                                                <div class="product-banner-description">
                                                    <p>The SiBG301 SoC family belongs to our next generation Series 3 platform that further extends our leadership in ultra-low power IoT SoCs and modules. Series 3 brings new levels of compute, security, RF performance, and power efficiency that are necessary to address emerging IoT markets. The SiBG301 is purpose built for line powered smart devices including LED lighting, plugs and switches.</p>
<p>The multi-core device has an ARM Cortex®-M33 running up to 150 MHz for application development and dedicated cores for the radio and security engine. Our Series 3 Secure Vault™ has been certified for PSA Certified Level 4, ensuring the highest level of attack resistance from PSA Certified, protecting both the data and the device. Memory options of up to 4 MB Flash and 512 kB RAM allow for more demanding applications for Bluetooth LE and Bluetooth mesh.</p>
<p>Optimized for LED lighting applications, select SiBG301 devices integrate key features including a PIXELRZ single wire communication interface for LED controller ICs as well as a LED pre-driver that enables low level and consistent dimming, resulting in a simplified design, reduced BOM, and lower product cost.</p>
</div>
                                                <div class="product-banner-page">
                                                    <div class="simple-cta">
                                                        <a href="https://www.silabs.com/wireless/bluetooth/sibg301-series-3-socs" class="button primary-red">Visit
                                                            SiBG301 Series 3 Low Power Bluetooth SoCs Ideal for Lighting
                                                            Family</a>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
