                            <h3 class="title">
                                Ultra-low Power, High Memory and High Security for Small Form Factor Devices
                            </h3>
                            <div class="custom-description">
                                The BG29 offers ultra-low power, high Flash and RAM, advanced security and DCDC Boost in an ultra-compact SoC, making it ideal for compact devices like asset trackers, tooth implants, and CGMs.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        
                            <div class="show-more">
                                <div class="simple-cta cta-align-center ">
