                                            <div class="product-banner-head">
                                                <h2>Ultra-Low Power, Cost-effective for Battery-Powered Devices</h2>
                                                <div class="product-banner-description">
                                                    <p>The BG22L Bluetooth low energy solution is a cost-effective SoC designed for connectionless applications. It utilizes low power RF technology and Secure Vault™ Mid to deliver exceptional battery life and robust security, allowing connectionless tags to function seamlessly for up to 10 years on a single coin cell battery. The pin-compatibility of this SoC with other device families in the Silicon Labs Bluetooth portfolio allows customers to seamlessly migrate to SoCs with expanded memory, higher clock speeds, and extended temperature range. Ideal for various applications, the BG22L provides efficiency and reliability, making it suitable for Bluetooth mesh low-power nodes, <a href="/applications/industrial-iot/asset-tracking">asset tracking tags</a>, and <a href="/applications/connected-health">personal healthcare devices</a>.</p>
</div>
