                            <h3 class="title">
                                Accelerate Mesh with Series 2 
                            </h3>
                            <div class="custom-description">
                                Whether developing Bluetooth mesh applications for smart homes, industrial, or medical environments, our BG21, BG22, and BG24 devices has your entire product lifecycle covered.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        
                            <div class="show-more">
                                <div class="simple-cta cta-align-center ">
