<div class="slbs2-generic-text row column" style="padding-bottom: 36px; ">
	<div style="	text-align: center;
"><h3>Explorer Kit</h3>
</div>
<div style="	text-align: center;
">For experimenting, our entry-level kit gives you five powerful development features, including an onboard debugger, traffic analyzer, virtual COM port, mobile tester app, and connectors for MikroE and Qwiic peripheral boards.<br />
</div>

</div>
</div>


    
    
