"><h3>Dev Kit</h3>
</div>
<div style="	text-align: center;
">For prototyping or field trials, this kit supports a coin cell and a connector for batteries or power supplies. The Arm Cortex-M series-based kits provide 2.4 GHz antenna, board controller, J-Link debugger, packet tracing, and virtual COM. <br />
