    <div class="generictext text parbase">

<div class="slbs2-generic-text row column">
	<h2>Bluetooth Software and Tools</h2>
<p>We’re continually investing in our Bluetooth software solutions to keep your products secure and ahead of the competition. Silicon Labs <a href="/software-and-tools/bluetooth-low-energy">Bluetooth Software Development Kit</a> (SDK) is part of the GSDK. It includes project examples and peripheral drivers, and the protocol stacks for Bluetooth Low Energy and Bluetooth Mesh.<br />
</p>

</div>
</div>


    
    
