			<div class="table-scroll">
				<div class="no-border ">
					<div class="no-alternate       " data-attr-col1="px" data-attr-hdr="px" data-attr-body="px">
						<table><tbody><tr><td><b>Multiprotocol Support</b></td><td>For Bluetooth, proprietary and 15.4 protocols on a single chip.</td></tr><tr><td><b>Apple HomeKit</b></td><td>Develop Bluetooth products for the world’s most popular smart home ecosystem.</td></tr><tr><td><b>Direction-finding</b></td><td>Enable indoor-positioning and way-finding on your IoT applications with sub-meter accuracy.</td></tr><tr><td><b>Wi-Fi Coexistence</b></td><td>Reduce interference and increase reliability in multi-radio devices.</td></tr></tbody></table>

					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="footer-text">
<p data-emptytext="Text"></p>
</div>
